{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/extras/bf584774506d392f59597f578df27a7e.avif?t=1759753175\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil wizard is trying to harm the <strong>Hero\u2019s health</strong> by sending waves of greasy burgers and sugary treats. Use spells from the magical cookbook and towers of healthy food to stop the enemy and keep the Hero safe. Defend the Hero alone or team up with a friend in co-op mode. With each level, the wizard\u2019s magic grows stronger, and his army of junk food becomes more diverse and dangerous!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place defensive towers made of <strong>healthy food</strong>. Each tower has unique abilities effective against specific types of junk food sent by the dark wizard. Upgrade your towers by choosing one of three upgrade paths\u2014each unlocks new powerful abilities and changes your defensive strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/extras/a05276f0afa219e48104e866e47d72fb.avif?t=1759753175\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect gear that drops during battles and equip it to your character to enhance their abilities. Level up your Hero, learn new skills, and experiment with different equipment combinations to create the perfect defense strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/extras/4b5b11a0a40b21461adfc91e03c198e9.avif?t=1759753175\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique towers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 thrilling levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 unique characters with special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of different enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various tower abilities and upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op mode for up to 2 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An engaging storyline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple game modes</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3921280?t=1759753175","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/ae5e0b616adb2eb0d79aea8ca7f550514b5ddf0b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759753175","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/90377531ec0c491a24cf7079f46c9ae15e3914ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759753175","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/90377531ec0c491a24cf7079f46c9ae15e3914ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759753175","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921280/extras/bf584774506d392f59597f578df27a7e.avif?t=1759753175\" width=616 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The evil wizard is trying to ha